    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1190a-a18">

                <pb facs="1271" n="1175" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg1175"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Circular.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-06-30"><hi rendition="#italic">June 30,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In connection with my telegram of the 29th
                    instant, which I confirm on the overleaf, I inclose herewith three copies of the
                    President’s proclamation<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1190a-f1"/> announcing the
                    institution of blockade of all the <pb facs="1272" n="1176" xml:id="pg1176"/>
                    ports on the south coast of Cuba, from Cape Frances to Cape Cruz, inclusive, and
                    also of the port of San Juan, Puerto Rico.</p>
                <p>One copy may be communicated to the minister for foreign affairs.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. B. Moore</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>(To all United States legations abroad.)</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
